<title>RUSSIA: TENNIS-KREMLIN CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-KREMLIN CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the $400,000 Kremlin Cup womens' tennis tournament on Tuesday:</p>
<p>First round:</p>
<p>Sabine Appelmans (Belgium) beat Alexandra Olsza (Poland) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Katerina Studenikova (Slovakia) beat Leila Meskhi (Georgia) 6-1 6-1</p>
<p>Elena Tatarkova (Ukraine) beat Eugenia Kulikovskaya (Russia) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>Tatiana Panova (Russia) beat Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) 6-4 6-4  </p>
<p>Add first round: Conchita Martinez beat Sandra Dopfer 6-3 6-3</p>
